        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I went to see Amin for my physio therapy, he was amazing and professional. Amin has always been in a great mood and funny so it makes doing some of the more painful stuff not as bad. I would highly recommend him to anyone who is in need of a physio therapist :)",
        "time": 1734457793,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ryan Tanner",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101222742359997883330/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIO6CNMcQgKPnj4k4hB7kWLkp2aMVbWUkSuoqc44BgGe9Xo7h8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have been receiving treatment at PhysioExtra for my herniated disc, including physiotherapy, occupational therapy, and acupuncture. The specialists here are incredibly nice, experienced, and truly caring. Each session has been highly effective, and the comprehensive approach has greatly improved my condition. I highly recommend this clinic for anyone seeking top-notch care and professional expertise.",
